  // Still employed, actively looking for an internal promotion or raise —
  // NOT "worried I'll be let go" (EMPLOYED_CONSIDERING_MOVE). Deliberately
  // its own value rather than reusing that one: this persona's recommended
  // strategy is the opposite in tone — build external leverage for an
  // internal ask, not prepare an exit — and it must never inherit
  // EMPLOYED_CONSIDERING_MOVE's Confidential Search Mode default (see
